      "\n",
      "THERAPIST (t=1): Hi there! It sounds like you’re really feeling the weight of anxiety when it comes to social situations. I hear you saying that you worry about saying something wrong or being judged, which makes you want to avoid those interactions altogether. That sounds really tough.\n",
