      "THERAPIST (t=4): It sounds like you’re experiencing a lot of fear and frustration when it comes to social situations. You mentioned feeling scared and having that critical voice in your head, which makes perfect sense given the pressure to connect with others. However, I also notice that there seems to be a deeper sense of heaviness in your voice, almost like there’s more going on beneath the surface.\n",
