      "\n",
      "THERAPIST (t=1): Hi there! It sounds like you’re carrying a heavy load with those feelings of being a burden. It's really common to feel overwhelmed, especially when it seems like reaching out might add more weight to those around you. I hear you saying you know you shouldn’t think that way, which suggests there’s a part of you that recognizes this thought might not be entirely true.\n",
