      "THERAPIST (t=2): It sounds like you're carrying a heavy weight with those feelings of being a burden, even when you know on some level that it shouldn’t be the case. It’s understandable to worry about adding to the stress of your friends and family, especially when you care about them. I hear you wanting to feel lighter and more connected, which is a really important goal.\n",
