      "\n",
      "THERAPIST (t=3): It sounds like you're carrying a heavy weight with the guilt of feeling like a burden. It's understandable that the thought of opening up to your friends and family brings so much anxiety. You want to feel connected, yet there's a deep fear of being judged or pushed away. \n",
